  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Order of one pass",
      "items": [
        "Secrets are decrypted before the lock: .env is read by everything after",
        "deploy_repo runs for rpi-homeserver, then for rpi-services if it is cloned",
        "Grafana, appdata owners, qbit-manage and the webhook unit are rpi-homeserver only; caddy reload runs for both repos",
        "Reloads and restarts run before the image plan, on the files git just changed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Gates",
      "items": [
        "A busy lock leaves .deploy.pending: the holder runs once more on exit, at most twice",
        "If the pull changed apply.sh, it execs the new file with DEPLOY_SELF_BEFORE and keeps the lock",
        "runs <service> skips steps for services this node does not run; sync scripts skip themselves"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Image plan",
      "items": [
        "GHCR-pinned services are pulled only if the pinned tag is missing; a failed pull builds locally",
        "Local build contexts are rebuilt only when their files, versions.env or a compose file changed",
        "up -d never uses --build, so an unchanged container is not recreated"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "After both repos",
      "items": [
        "Crontab: scripts/crontab with @PROJECT_DIR@ filled in and # when: jobs dropped where the service or file is absent",
        "Sync: arr-config, config-export --check (if autobrr or maintainerr), pihole-dns, arr-links, plex-prefs, qbit-config, jellyfin-guide"
      ]
    }
  ]
}